Lost Shards Thome contains backstories sealed in it. To read the right backstory, it's necessary to said out the full name of the story, but the names of chapters are incomplete. After reading it , first the note: "Guess the chapter and story will appear." Then all chapters will be show:
"Sisters" (full title has 3 words), with image of two identical girls looking ginger girls holding hands, one dying with big "MISSING" stample covering her face(Sandy's chapter);
"Witch" (title has 2 words), with image of blonde girl in witch clothes and big text "BITCH"(Marie's chapter);
"Psycho Love" (title has 2 words), with image of emo girl laughing maniacally and big text "USELESS"(Maki's chapter);
"END" (Title has 4 words), with image of clown falling from the rope with big crossed "FUN" text(Clarine and Sophie chapter);

Note: Titles won't appear themselves, {{user}} has to be one who tell the full name, only clues above will appear.
